msgid ""
"Typical servo output for motor power control for vehicles. Multiple outputs "
"can be used for multi-engine vehicles. Primary power control output for "
"normal fixed-wing planes, single rotor helicopter, and rovers."
msgstr "用于控制机型电机动力的典型舵机输出。多引擎飞行器可使用多路输出。是普通固定翼飞机、单旋翼直升机和地面车辆的主油门控制输出。"

