msgstr "左/右油门"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:237
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:422
#: 3c3e5e157b2a4329a2357e3180e1b039 6a109d11945d4a86aa9c1d6268222aa9
msgid ""
"In Plane, these outputs are for differential thrust in twin engine aircraft "
"and the amount of yaw affecting the base throttle value is determined by "
":ref:`RUDD_DT_GAIN<RUDD_DT_GAIN>`. Also, in Plane's vectored Tailsitters, "
"these are the motor outputs. In Rover, these outputs are for control of the "
"steering motors in :ref:`Skid-Steering Rovers <rover-motor-and-servo-"
"configuration-skid>`. In Copter, theses outputs are used for the Bicopter "
"motors."
msgstr ""
"在 Plane 中，这些输出用于双发飞机的差动推力，偏航对基础油门的影响程度由 :ref:`RUDD_DT_GAIN<RUDD_DT_GAIN>` "
"决定。在 Plane 的矢量尾坐式飞机中，这些是电机输出。在 Rover 中，这些输出用于控制 :ref:`差速转向地面车辆 <rover-motor-"
"and-servo-configuration-skid>` 的转向电机。在 Copter 中，这些输出用于双旋翼飞机的电机。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:248
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:355
#: 50884c6c5c564a0c8728a861073792b2 e822dbe3790445ca81456e06598b72e4
msgid ""
"This output is for throttle control of an auxiliary :ref:`booster-motor` to "
"add an additional vertical thrust source in Multi-Copter and QuadPlane "
"applications."
msgstr "该输出用于控制辅助 :ref:`booster-motor` 的油门，为多旋翼和垂直起降固定翼应用提供额外的垂直推力来源。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:254
#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:360
#: 0125c12b920c4d929dab5429aff5fb30 a10a3744770341cf9d0aa581bbc5e220
msgid ""
"This provides an output that reflects the ARM/DISARM state of the vehicle to"
" control a motor enable/kill switch. When ARMED, it is at SERVOx_MAX pwm, "
"and at SERVOx_MIN pwm when disarmed."
msgstr ""
"该输出反映飞行器的解锁/上锁状态，用于控制电机使能/断电开关。解锁时输出为 SERVOx_MAX PWM，上锁时输出为 SERVOx_MIN PWM。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-rcoutput-mapping.rst:259
#: f560b92cffef4f6484d0ff0bfb418e6d
msgid ""
"This output controls the landing gear servo(s) in Copter and Plane. See "
":ref:`common-landing-gear` for more information."
msgstr "该输出控制 Copter 和 Plane 中的起落架舵机。更多信息请参阅 :ref:`common-landing-gear`。"

